<title>JAPAN: Okano Valve -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Okano Valve -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to May 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.18		vs	    6.99</p>
<p> Operating   loss 465    million	  vs	prft 164 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 479    million	  vs	prft 162 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 485    million	  vs	 prft 38 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 27.06 yen	  vs     prft 2.17 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     18 million	  vs	  18 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	    2.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Okano Valve Mfg Co is Japan&quot;s largest and pioneer manufacturer of large high-temperature, high-pressure valves.</p>
</text>
